## Refunds[​](#refunds "Direct link to Refunds")

You can issue full or partial refunds, and the 3.8% portion of our fee will be returned proportionally. The $0.50 per-transaction fee is non-refundable, and Stripe and PayPal also do not refund their processing fees.

The fixed fee covers transaction-level costs that are incurred regardless of whether a purchase is later refunded, including invoicing, data storage and retention, support, and fraud, dispute, and chargeback handling.

## Dispute and Chargeback Fees[​](#dispute-and-chargeback-fees "Direct link to Dispute and Chargeback Fees")

We handle disputes and chargebacks on your behalf, achieving astoundingly high winning rates: 29.6% for credit card disputes, and nearly all PayPal disputes resolved in our favor. Keep in mind that a dispute fee of $15 to $20 is deducted directly by payment processors from your balance, if the dispute is lost.
